Package: BlackThriveSS
Title: Reproduce Black Thrive Stop and Search Dashboard Evidence
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mustapha", "Wasseja", email = "mustapha.wasseja.mohammed@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Black Thrive Global", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: Retrieve fixed, documented snapshots of public aggregate stop and
    search evidence used by the Black Thrive dashboard: force, council and
    national tables from 2018 onwards with monthly reporting coverage and
    provenance. Recreate the dashboard's force ranking of group to White stop
    rates for any year and group as an editable plot, replay a saved chart
    specification, and exchange links with the dashboard website, all without
    a running dashboard or network connection. Contains public sector
    information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0. Source
    documentation is available at <https://data.police.uk/about/>.
